 "text": "Luxury buyers don't fill in forms. They browse. They compare. They come back at midnight to look again. Most sales teams never see any of it. So the hottest buyers wait, and quietly go cold. frontdesk AI changes that. It tracks every visit, click and inquiry across your website and campaigns. It scores each buyer's intent and ranks your leads, so your team always knows who's ready. And the moment a buyer shows real interest, it follows up personally, and alerts the right agent. Fewer missed buyers. Faster viewings. A sales team that always knows who to call next. frontdesk AI. Book your free lead flow audit.",
